---
source: src/ui/mod.rs
expression: render(&app)
---
"┌─[1]─Statu┌ Keybindings ─ Main ────────────────────────────────────┐──────────┐"
"│◐ dev → ad│  j/↓  next run, or scroll a line                       │ Result   │"
"│3 of 3 job│  k/↑  previous run, or scroll a line                   │ ◐ RUNNING│"
"│◐ 1 · ✗ 1 │   ^D  ten runs or lines down                           │ ✓ SUCCESS│"
"└──────────│   ^U  ten runs or lines up                             │ ✗ FAILED │"
"┌─[2]─Jobs │Enter  open the run; on JSON and Output, page the text  │          │"
"│ 2h ◐ [som│l/]/→  next tab                                         │          │"
"│ 1d ✗ nigh│h/[/←  previous tab                                     │          │"
"│    · week│  Esc  back: close the run, then the panel              │          │"
"│          │    x  actions menu                                     │          │"
"│          │    r  refresh runs                                     │          │"
"│          │    o  open job in browser                              │          │"
"│          │    y  copy job URL                                     │          │"
"└──────────│    Y  copy the runs table as text                      │          │"
"┌─[3]─Pipel│  0-4  focus panel by number                            │          │"
"│          │  Tab  next side panel                                  │──────────┘"
"│          │    R  refresh everything                               │──────────┐"
"│          │    +  cycle screen mode                                │00    84ms│"
"└──────────│    @  toggle the API log                               │00   131ms│"
"┌─[4]─Compu│    A  enable or disable actions this session           │          │"
"│          │    p  switch profile: any in ~/.databrickscfg          │          │"
"│          │    ?  this list                                        │          │"
"└──────────│ q/^C  quit                                             │──────────┘"
" Scroll: j/└───────────────────────Esc: close───────────────────────┘     v0.1.0"
